{"3980130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Throne Raiders", "steam_appid": 3980130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throne Raiders is a casual top-down RTS where classic strategy combines with card mechanics and roguelike elements. You choose a hero of the kingdom, gather a squad, and embark on a campaign through a chain of randomly generated islands. Each island is ruled by its own overlord. Defeat them and restore order to a world full of magic and strange creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition turns into a journey through a chain of distinctive islands. On each island, a short but intense skirmish awaits you. Build a base, gather resources, assemble an army, and destroy the monster camp guarding the territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step, enemies grow stronger, and the loot becomes more generous. Reach the final boss and complete the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Base and Manage Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable resources to develop your settlement. Construct barracks, workshops, and defensive towers, strengthen your economy, and expand your army's capabilities. The gameplay remains simple and intuitive, but each battle will require thoughtful tactics and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards aren't just buffs—they're a full-fledged tool that brings variety to every battle. New effects and abilities change tactical decisions right in the middle of combat, making each encounter truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-built deck allows you to influence strategy more deeply: boost your economy, take control of the situation with abilities, or turn the tide of battle with powerful tactical effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on expeditions solo or team up with friends—up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together is easier—but also harder at the same time: the more players, the more powerful the world itself becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy with card mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic system and progression between expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Chaos events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and friendly fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throne Raiders is a casual top-down RTS where classic strategy combines with card mechanics and roguelike elements. You choose a hero of the kingdom, gather a squad, and embark on a campaign through a chain of randomly generated islands. Each island is ruled by its own overlord. Defeat them and restore order to a world full of magic and strange creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition turns into a journey through a chain of distinctive islands. On each island, a short but intense skirmish awaits you. Build a base, gather resources, assemble an army, and destroy the monster camp guarding the territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step, enemies grow stronger, and the loot becomes more generous. Reach the final boss and complete the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/5cb70a35ca4593ec766baf4bfbd0ca43.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Base and Manage Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable resources to develop your settlement. Construct barracks, workshops, and defensive towers, strengthen your economy, and expand your army's capabilities. The gameplay remains simple and intuitive, but each battle will require thoughtful tactics and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/3369c56c68d86c1b258af5a79bc6e3ff.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards aren't just buffs—they're a full-fledged tool that brings variety to every battle. New effects and abilities change tactical decisions right in the middle of combat, making each encounter truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-built deck allows you to influence strategy more deeply: boost your economy, take control of the situation with abilities, or turn the tide of battle with powerful tactical effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.poster.avif?t=1765031795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.webm?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/extras/2f38d32cbc7b4757510a4c068aa27500.mp4?t=1765031795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on expeditions solo or team up with friends—up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together is easier—but also harder at the same time: the more players, the more powerful the world itself becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy with card mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic system and progression between expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Chaos events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and friendly fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Throne Raiders is a new type of RTS that combines real-time strategy with deck-building features. Lead expeditions across risky islands, build your settlement, and command your heroes in quick battles. Collect powerful cards, adjust your strategy, and defeat the final boss to finish your expedition.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980130/d5e5823bf8ea50fbb01235dc7ea09ee12617829d/header.jpg?t=1765031795", "capsule_image"